  "html": "<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col col-8\"><h2>Ply Kitting Machine</h2><figure><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Ply-Kitting-Machine-a.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><div class=\"center\">\n\t\t\t<ul>\n<li>Generates ply kits from rolls of fabric prepreg</li>\n<li>Four individual cutting stations</li>\n<li>Kit platform moves up or down to accept each ply</li>\n<li>Prepares kits up to 18 ft (5.5&nbsp;m) long</li>\n<li>Kits up to 50 plies thick</li>\n</ul>\n</div></div><div class=\"col col-4\">\n\t\t\t<nav class=\"side-nav\"><h3 class=\"widget-title\">Specialty Machines</h3><ul><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/specialty-machines/off-axis-laminator/\">Off-Axis Laminator</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/specialty-machines/tool-wrapper-and-sealer/\">Tool Wrapper and Sealer</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/specialty-machines/motion-platform-relay-machine/\">Motion Platform / Relay Machine</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/specialty-machines/ndt-ir-camera-motion-platform/\">NDT IR Camera Motion Platform</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/specialty-machines/foam-cutting-machine/\">Foam Cutting Machine</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/specialty-machines/noodle-former-radius-filler/\">Noodle Former / Radius Filler</a></li><li class=\"current\"><a href=\"/composites-automation/specialty-machines/ply-kitting-machine/\">Ply Kitting Machine</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/specialty-machines/tape-splicer/\">Tape Splicer</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/specialty-machines/thermoplastic-filament-winding/\">Thermoplastic Filament Winding</a></li></ul></nav>\n</div></div><h3>Machine Images</h3><div class=\"gallery\"><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Ply-Kitting-Machine-b.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Ply-Kitting-Machine-b-300x209.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"209\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Ply-Kitting-Machine-a.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/C